,"html_url":"https://github.com/sjkillen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkillen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T17:58:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T17:58:32Z","body":"Can confirm it works if the texture read is performed in the fragment function.\nI don't see this documented anywhere and isn't an issue with the Forward+ renderer","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3180415462/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250639163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109553#issuecomment-3250639163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109553","id":3250639163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BwNE7","user":{"login":"gitsomebit","id":182990993,"node_id":"U_kgDOCug4kQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182990993?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit","html_url":"https://github.com/gitsomebit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitsomebit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T20:16:10Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T20:16:10Z","body":"> isn't an issue with the Forward+ renderer\n\nIs there a good reason why the renderers diverge on this? Costed me a lot of nerve to find this issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250639163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250796335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109553#issuecomment-3250796335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109553","id":3250796335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Bwzcv","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T21:03:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T21:03:12Z","body":"The shader compiler tries to reference a uniform called `depth_buffer` in the [core shader](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/core_and_modules/internal_rendering_architecture.html#doc-internal-rendering-architecture-core-shaders) (not your shader): https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6c9aa4c7d3b9b91cd50714c40eeb234874df7075/servers/rendering/shader_compiler.cpp#L938-L940\n\nThis uniform exists in [Forward+](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6c9aa4c7d3b9b91cd50714c40eeb234874df7075/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_clustered/scene_forward_clustered_inc.glsl#L399) and in [Mobile](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6c9aa4c7d3b9b91cd50714c40eeb234874df7075/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/forward_mobile/scene_forward_mobile_inc.glsl#L353), and also in [Compatibility](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6c9aa4c7d3b9b91cd50714c40eeb234874df7075/drivers/gles3/shaders/scene.glsl#L1247), but the uniform can't be referenced while running in Compatibility for some reason.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250796335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250889268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109553#issuecomment-3250889268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109553","id":3250889268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BxKI0","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T21:36:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T21:36:17Z","body":"I think the problem is that it is only defined in the fragment shader for compatibility. I bet we just need to make sure it is defined both in the vertex shader and in the fragment shader for it to work","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250889268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250997364","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109553#issuecomment-3250997364","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109553","id":3250997364,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Bxkh0","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T22:21:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T22:35:19Z","body":"I can confirm the issue on 4.5.beta7.\n\n> I think the problem is that it is only defined in the fragment shader for compatibility. I bet we just need to make sure it is defined both in the vertex shader and in the fragment shader for it to work\n\nThat makes sense, as `scene_forward_*_inc.glsl` are included twice in `scene_forward_*.glsl` (once in `[vertex]`, once in `[fragment]`).\n\n**Edit:** I've tried to add it to `[vertex]` and that didn't fix the issue. Looking at the shader error, we can see the shader error occurs on a line that is prior to the `depth_buffer` uniform declaration. Moving `#GLOBALS` to be below fixes the shader compilation error, without needing to add more uniforms.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250997364/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]